33322.a:
```yaml
receivers:  { otlp: { protocols: { grpc: {}, http: {} } } }
processors:
  memory_limiter: { limit_mib: 512 }
  batch: {}
  attributes: { actions: [{ key: user.email, action: delete }] }
  tail_sampling:
    policies:
    - { name: errors, type: status_code, status_code: { status_codes: [ERROR] } }
    - { name: slow,   type: latency, latency: { threshold_ms: 1000 } }
exporters:  { otlp/tempo: { endpoint: tempo:4317 } }
service:
  pipelines:
    traces: { receivers: [otlp], processors: [memory_limiter, tail_sampling, batch], exporters: [otlp/tempo] }
```
Joylash: agent (DaemonSet/sidecar) + gateway (markaziy). Tail sampling bitta trace'ning hamma span'lari bitta collector'ga tushishini talab qiladi.

33328.a:
**Qisqa javob:** **Resource** — Terraform yaratadi, o'zgartiradi, o'chiradi (lifecycle'ga egalik qiladi). **Data source** — mavjud narsani faqat **o'qiydi** (boshqa jamoa yaratgan VPC, AMI, akkaunt ID). Narsa sizniki bo'lmasa — `data`.

**Qanday ishlaydi:**
```
data.aws_vpc.shared  (o'qish, plan paytida)  --> id
          v
resource aws_instance.app (yaratish) uses data.*.id
```

**Amalda:**
```hcl
data "aws_caller_identity" "current" {}
data "aws_region" "current" {}

data "aws_vpc" "shared" {
  tags = { Name = "shared-prod" }
}

data "aws_subnets" "private" {
  filter {
    name   = "vpc-id"
    values = [data.aws_vpc.shared.id]
  }
  tags = { tier = "private" }
}

resource "aws_instance" "app" {
  ami           = var.ami_id
  instance_type = "t3.small"
  subnet_id     = data.aws_subnets.private.ids[0]
}

locals {
  account_id = data.aws_caller_identity.current.account_id
}
```

| | resource | data |
|---|---|---|
| Yaratadi | ha | yo'q |
| destroy'da | o'chadi | tegilmaydi |
| Topilmasa | yaratadi | plan xato beradi |

**Tuzoqlar:**
- `most_recent = true` AMI — yangi AMI chiqqanda instance **replace**. Prod'da AMI ID'ni pin qiling yoki `ignore_changes = [ami]`.
- Filtr bir nechta natija qaytarsa (`aws_vpc`) — xato; filtrni aniqlashtiring.
- Data source boshqa resursga bog'liq bo'lsa, qiymat "known after apply" bo'lib, keraksiz replace chaqiradi.

**Senior nuqta:** Data source — jamoalar orasidagi bo'shroq kontrakt (tag yoki nom bo'yicha). Tag'lar kontrakt ekanini hujjatlashtiring, aks holda kimdir tag'ni o'zgartirib, boshqaning plan'ini buzadi.
